cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Bayesian optimisation benchmark for N-heterocyclic carbene design"
abstract: >-
  Pool-based Bayesian optimisation with feature selection (FABO, PCA, PLS, OPLS) against a vanilla GP and
  model-free controls on three molecular representations of 6,850 N-heterocyclic carbenes, with xTB binding
  free energies as the target, plus a tuned surrogate benchmark including Chemprop and tabular foundation models.
authors:
